format: 3
name: a qualified java.util.Optional is an Optional
class: Case
method: m
arg: d8799f05ff
expect: AGREE
note: ADR-068 D7. The reference needs a datum where a validator takes this type, which only a validator shows (Adr068TypeIdentityTest).
